# Track the bundled agent_memory copy that ships inside the SWE-agent tool
# (see CLAUDE.md gotcha #10). neo4j/pytz/wheels under lib/ stay ignored —
# those are installed by install.sh at container build time.
!tools/query_memory/lib/
!tools/query_memory/lib/agent_memory/
!tools/query_memory/lib/agent_memory/**
